{"path":"keyword/export","title":"C++ keyword: export","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ keyword:</span><code>export</code>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/keyword/export","section":"keyword","kind":"index","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx11\"><td>\n<p>Used to mark a <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/class_template\">template definition</a> <i>exported</i>, which  allows the same template to be declared, but not defined, in other translation units.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx20\"><td>\n<p><i>The keyword is unused and reserved.</i>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span><br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>Marks a declaration, a group of declarations, or another <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/modules\">module</a> as exported by the current <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/modules\">module</a>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx11\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/template\"><code>template</code></a> <small>(mark a template definition exported)</small>\n</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/identifier_with_special_meaning/import\"><code>import</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/identifier_with_special_meaning/module\"><code>module</code></a>\n</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Usage","id":"Usage"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"keyword","title":"C++ keywords"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C++ keyword: export","children":[{"label":"Usage"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":66,"codeBlockCount":0}
